      "source": "Class for creating Function callbacks around prompt list changed consumer methods that\nreturn Mono.\n\nThis class provides a way to convert methods annotated with\n<a href=\"../../../McpPromptListChanged.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.ai.mcp.annotation\"><code>McpPromptListChanged</code></a> into callback functions that can be used to handle prompt\nlist change notifications in a reactive way. It supports methods with a single\nList&lt;McpSchema.Prompt&gt; parameter.",
      "translation": "用于在返回 Mono 的提示列表变更消费者方法周围创建 Function 回调的类。\n\n该类提供了一种将带有<a href=\"../../../McpPromptListChanged.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.ai.mcp.annotation\"><code>McpPromptListChanged</code></a>注解的方法转换为回调函数的方法，以便以响应式方式处理提示列表变更通知。它支持具有单个 List&lt;McpSchema.Prompt&gt; 参数的方法。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
